        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So when companions are incapacitated.... is that the same thing as heros being incapacitated for Bonuses or skirmish goals?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Example if one of Unity&#39;s bots is incapacitated by Barron Blade does he get the bonus in the scenarios as if he incapacitated Unity herself? And for skirmishes would an incapacitated citizen or bot be a +1 for the team that incapacitated it?&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
